        {
          "name": "flight-controllers",
          "type": "forum",
          "topic": "One post per change: a new board, a revision or one feature.\nTitle: <product>: <change>, for example \"OpenFC-Lite: move the USB connector\".\nTag the product and the kind of work. The bot sets the lifecycle tag (planned, in progress, alpha, beta, launched) from the repository.\nSay it here before you start: KiCad files cannot be merged, so if two people edit the same board one of them loses their work. /editing lists the open pull requests that change KiCad files.\nWhen the pull request is open, run /link with its URL in the post so reviews, merges and releases show up here.",
